{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05274","headline":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾移天跸，凭轩览汉都。\n寒烟收紫禁，春色绕黄图。\n旧史遗陈迹，前王失霸符。\n山河寸土尽，宫观尺椽无。\n崇高惟在德，壮丽岂爲谟。\n茨室留皇鉴，熏歌盛有虞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}